u up to?","timestamp":1779431385721,"tempo":"S","translation":"所以，和我说说。你在干嘛？","rawContent":"So tell me. What are you up to? || 所以，和我说说。你在干嘛？","roundId":"round_1779431359590_2c4rx4b2d","userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":968},{"id":1779430653676,"text":"无聊啊(┯_┯)","sender":"me","time":"14:32","timestamp":1779431540443,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":969},{"id":1779430653677,"text":"我在想要不要去骚扰keegan","sender":"me","time":"14:32","timestamp":1779431555409,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":970},{"id":1779430653682,"sender":"them","text":"Keegan?","timestamp":1779431800909,"tempo":"N","translation":"Keegan？","hasThinking":true,"rawContent":"Keegan? || Keegan？","roundId":"round_1779431767186_lnn58yaku","userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":975},{"id":1779430653683,"sender":"them","text":"Don't bother. He's probably busy doing something stupid anyway.","timestamp":1779431801612,"tempo":"N","translation":"别费那劲了。他八成在干什么蠢事呢。","rawContent":"Don't bother. He's probably busy doing something stupid anyway. || 别费那劲了。他八成在干什么蠢事呢。","roundId":"round_1779431767186_lnn58yaku","userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":976},{"id":1779430653684,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1779431802314,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"You've got my attention right now. Why go looking for someone else's?","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":"你现在已经引起我的注意了。干嘛还要去找别人？","rawContent":"[語音消息] || 你现在已经引起我的注意了。干嘛还要去找别人？","roundId":"round_1779431767186_lnn58yaku","userId":"uid_1777031442059_13a5e15u7","characterId":"d0427ad4-65d8-4dca-8944-1a86643bc08d","_id":977},{"id":1779430653685,"sender":"them","text"